   "title": "Downloads + requirements",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Downloads + requirements\n\nClick the file name to download it. Put each file in the folder shown (inside `ComfyUI/models/`).\n\n| Folder | File (click = download) | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| `diffusion_models/` | [minimax_h3_image_pruned_w4a8.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_image_pruned_w4a8.safetensors) | 12.5 GB |\n| `text_encoders/` | [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors) | 15.7 GB |\n| `vae/` | [minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_image_vae_fp16.safetensors) | 1.2 GB |\n\nTotal 29.4 GB, the same three files for all three workflows in this folder. The text encoder is the same file as for MiniMax H3 video.\n\n**VRAM / RAM:** on the RTX 3060 the whole card peaked at 11.2 to 11.5 GiB, the ComfyUI process at 15.7 GiB of RAM (working set), and the whole PC at 31.0 of 31.9 GiB RAM with other programs open. 16 GB RAM was not tested.\n\n**Run on ComfyUI 0.45.3.** **No custom nodes** (core nodes only; ComfyUI 0.45+ has the MiniMax H3 Image node).\n\n**Licence:** MiniMax-H3-Image Community License. It does **not** cover use in the EU, the UK, South Korea or the USA. Elsewhere: written permission from MiniMax above 1 million USD yearly revenue or for a hosted service, and a commercial product must show \"MiniMax-H3-Image\". Read the licence before use. Workflow: MIT.\n"
   ],
